{
  "version": 2,
  "size": "a4",
  "margin": { "top": 30, "right": 30, "bottom": 30, "left": 30 },
  "applyBorder": false,
  "border": 1,
  "fFamily": "Times-Roman",
  "newDoc": true,
  "filePath": "",
  "_notes": [
    "Section-based conversion of the legacy hardcoded Default1 design (buildPage.default.js createHeader/createBody/createFooter) — the legacy partition lines are restored as editable section partitions: the header's vertical x=300 line and the y=60 horizontal, the body's x=300 line through the table zone, and the footer's x=300 / x=460 verticals plus the y=650 horizontal. The table band lines (y=225/260, column verticals) come from the TableBlock drawGrid.",
    "Approximations vs the legacy fixed coordinates: zone heights are designer-editable (body is fixed so the table pages inside its zone; header/footer auto-size); the y=60 line spans the right column only because it lives on the right column's section (legacy: x=300..600); the footer columns are 50% / 25% / 25% instead of 50% / 27% / 23%; the tax-split mini-boxes (y 630-650) become a 3-cell row above the totals with cell-boundary partitions; bank-account separator lines are dropped (one biller-bank block); (%) tax sub-lines and item desc sub-lines in the table are dropped.",
    "Renderer collapses blocks whose value is empty, so optional fields (transporter, ship-to, scrap TDS) leave no gap."
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "d1-header",
      "type": "header",
      "name": "Header",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "cornerRadius": 10,
      "height": 0,
      "columns": 2,
      "padding": 8,
      "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
      "applyBorder": false,
      "partitions": [ { "direction": "col", "range": 50, "lWidth": 1 } ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "d1-biller-cell",
          "type": "section",
          "name": "Biller",
          "shape": "rectangle",
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "height": 0,
          "columns": 1,
          "padding": 0,
          "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
          "applyBorder": false,
          "partitions": [],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "d1-biller-name",
              "type": "variable",
              "variable": "biller-name",
              "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 18, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
              "align": "left",
              "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 4, "left": 0 }
            },
            { "id": "d1-biller-addr", "type": "variable", "variable": "biller-address", "prefix": "Address: ", "align": "left" },
            { "id": "d1-biller-ph", "type": "variable", "variable": "biller-phone", "prefix": "Contact number: ", "align": "left" },
            { "id": "d1-biller-gst", "type": "variable", "variable": "biller-gst", "prefix": "GST number: ", "align": "left", "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 8, "left": 0 } },
            {
              "id": "d1-biller-bank",
              "type": "variable",
              "variable": "biller-bank",
              "align": "left",
              "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 10, "bold": false, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
              "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 12, "left": 0 }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d1-meta-cell",
          "type": "section",
          "name": "Invoice & Customer",
          "shape": "rectangle",
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "height": 0,
          "columns": 1,
          "padding": 0,
          "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
          "applyBorder": false,
          "partitions": [ { "direction": "row", "range": 15, "lWidth": 1 } ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "d1-copy",
              "type": "variable",
              "variable": "bill-copy",
              "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 14, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
              "align": "right",
              "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 10, "left": 0 }
            },
            {
              "id": "d1-inv-no",
              "type": "variable",
              "variable": "bill-no-formatted",
              "prefix": "Invoice No: ",
              "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 12, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
              "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 6, "left": 0 }
            },
            { "id": "d1-date", "type": "variable", "variable": "date-slash", "prefix": "Date: ", "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 6, "left": 0 } },
            {
              "id": "d1-billto-label",
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Bill to:",
              "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 12, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
              "margin": { "top": 8, "right": 0, "bottom": 4, "left": 0 }
            },
            { "id": "d1-cust-name", "type": "variable", "variable": "customer-name" },
            { "id": "d1-cust-addr", "type": "variable", "variable": "customer-address" },
            { "id": "d1-cust-ph", "type": "variable", "variable": "customer-phone", "prefix": "Ph: " },
            { "id": "d1-cust-gst", "type": "variable", "variable": "customer-gst", "prefix": "GST: " },
            { "id": "d1-ship-label", "type": "text", "content": "Ship to:", "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 12, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" }, "margin": { "top": 8, "right": 0, "bottom": 4, "left": 0 } },
            { "id": "d1-ship-to", "type": "variable", "variable": "shipTo" },
            { "id": "d1-ship-addr", "type": "variable", "variable": "shipAddr" },
            { "id": "d1-ship-ph", "type": "variable", "variable": "shipPh", "prefix": "Ph: " },
            { "id": "d1-ship-gst", "type": "variable", "variable": "shipGST", "prefix": "GST: " },
            { "id": "d1-orderref", "type": "variable", "variable": "orderRef", "prefix": "Order Ref: ", "margin": { "top": 8, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 } },
            { "id": "d1-transporter", "type": "variable", "variable": "transportName", "prefix": "Transporter: " }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-body",
      "type": "body",
      "name": "Body",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "cornerRadius": 10,
      "height": 359,
      "columns": 1,
      "padding": 0,
      "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
      "applyBorder": false,
      "partitions": [ { "direction": "col", "range": 50, "lWidth": 1 } ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "d1-table",
          "type": "table",
          "thHeight": 24,
          "fSize": 12,
          "rSpacing": 4,
          "cellPadding": 4,
          "drawGrid": true,
          "margin": { "top": 12, "right": 0, "bottom": 12, "left": 0 },
          "cols": [
            { "label": "Sl No", "variable": "slno", "width": 5 },
            { "label": "Product Description", "variable": "name", "width": 25 },
            { "label": "HSN", "variable": "hsn", "width": 8 },
            { "label": "Quantity", "variable": "qty", "width": 6 },
            { "label": "Unit", "variable": "unit", "width": 6 },
            { "label": "Unit Price", "variable": "unit-price", "width": 8 },
            { "label": "Amount", "variable": "amount", "width": 10 },
            { "label": "CGST", "variable": "CGST", "width": 8 },
            { "label": "SGST", "variable": "SGST", "width": 8 },
            { "label": "IGST", "variable": "IGST", "width": 8 },
            { "label": "Total", "variable": "total", "width": 8 }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-footer",
      "type": "footer",
      "name": "Footer",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "cornerRadius": 10,
      "height": 0,
      "columns": 2,
      "padding": 8,
      "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
      "applyBorder": false,
      "partitions": [
        { "direction": "col", "range": 50, "lWidth": 1 },
        { "direction": "row", "range": 16, "lWidth": 1 }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "d1-words-cell",
          "type": "section",
          "name": "Words & Signature",
          "shape": "rectangle",
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "height": 0,
          "columns": 1,
          "padding": 0,
          "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
          "applyBorder": false,
          "partitions": [],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "d1-words",
              "type": "variable",
              "variable": "gtotal-words",
              "prefix": "Total in words: ",
              "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 12, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
              "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 8, "left": 0 }
            },
            { "id": "d1-netqty", "type": "variable", "variable": "netQty", "prefix": "Total quantity: ", "suffix": " Kg" },
            {
              "id": "d1-sign-label",
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Authorised Signatory",
              "align": "right",
              "margin": { "top": 20, "right": 0, "bottom": 4, "left": 0 }
            },
            {
              "id": "d1-sign-for",
              "type": "variable",
              "variable": "biller-name",
              "prefix": "For ",
              "suffix": " (Proprietor)",
              "align": "right",
              "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 20, "left": 0 }
            },
            {
              "id": "d1-seal",
              "type": "image",
              "source": "seal",
              "imgWidth": 12,
              "imgHeight": 12,
              "imgOpacity": 100,
              "applyAspectRatio": true,
              "aspectRatio": "1:1",
              "align": "right",
              "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 12, "left": 0 }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d1-totals-receiver-cell",
          "type": "section",
          "name": "Totals & Receiver",
          "shape": "rectangle",
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "height": 0,
          "columns": 2,
          "padding": 0,
          "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
          "applyBorder": false,
          "partitions": [ { "direction": "col", "range": 50, "lWidth": 1 } ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "d1-totals-cell",
              "type": "section",
              "name": "Totals",
              "shape": "rectangle",
              "cornerRadius": 10,
              "height": 0,
              "columns": 1,
              "padding": 0,
              "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
              "applyBorder": false,
              "partitions": [],
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "d1-tax-split-cell",
                  "type": "section",
                  "name": "Tax Split",
                  "shape": "rectangle",
                  "cornerRadius": 10,
                  "height": 0,
                  "columns": 3,
                  "padding": 0,
                  "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
                  "applyBorder": false,
                  "partitions": [
                    { "direction": "col", "range": 33.33, "lWidth": 1 },
                    { "direction": "col", "range": 66.67, "lWidth": 1 }
                  ],
                  "blocks": [
                    { "id": "d1-tax-cgst", "type": "variable", "variable": "net-CGST", "prefix": "CGST: " },
                    { "id": "d1-tax-sgst", "type": "variable", "variable": "net-SGST", "prefix": "SGST: " },
                    { "id": "d1-tax-igst", "type": "variable", "variable": "net-IGST", "prefix": "IGST: " }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "d1-totals",
                  "type": "totals",
                  "margin": { "top": 8, "right": 0, "bottom": 8, "left": 0 },
                  "rows": [
                    { "label": "Total before Tax", "variable": "total-before-tax", "align": "right" },
                    { "label": "Total discount", "variable": "total-discount", "align": "right" },
                    { "label": "Total Tax", "variable": "netTax", "align": "right" },
                    { "label": "Scrap TDS", "variable": "scrap-tds", "align": "right" },
                    { "label": "Rounded off", "variable": "ro", "align": "right" },
                    { "label": "Grand Total", "variable": "grand-total", "align": "right" }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "d1-receiver-cell",
              "type": "section",
              "name": "Receiver",
              "shape": "rectangle",
              "cornerRadius": 10,
              "height": 0,
              "columns": 1,
              "padding": 0,
              "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
              "applyBorder": false,
              "partitions": [],
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "d1-receiver",
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Receiver's signature",
                  "margin": { "top": 16, "right": 0, "bottom": 8, "left": 0 }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
